# NOTE: `dotnet.system.threading.tasks` is deliberately NOT ambient —
# bare `Task.Run`/`Task.Delay` take the compiler's THREAD_SPAWN/JSPI
# special path, which the descriptor's common-emit duplicate must not
# shadow (three task_combinators tests regressed when it did).
